                ^"Category" STRING "Shinobi Item"
                ^"Cost" STRING "12 zeni"
                ^"Rarity" INTEGER 3
                ^"Qualities" LIST OF STRING ["Forbidden"]
                ^"Effect" STRING "As an Attack action, a character with an uchitake can start a fire at a point at range 0–2, and if the flames catch somewhere flammable, they spread quickly, creating terrain with the Dangerous and Obscuring qualities. If a person is standing at the target point (or the coals are shot directly at them), they must resist with a TN 2 Fitness check [Water 1, Air 4] or suffer the Burning condition."
            }
